  "body": "I'm excited about this project and looking for ways to contribute.\r\n\r\nI thought I could implement a polyfill for the latest draft, but then found that there [used to be](https://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/issues/27#issuecomment-393237396) one here. Do you think it would be helpful to make another one now for non-supporting browsers?\r\n\r\nI was also considering try to fill in the \"Cookie Store Caching\" section in the explainer, as we have already implemented something similar at Surfly. Perhaps that would be useful?",
